The loaded Foundation dylib and the macOS 15.2, 15.5, 26.0 and 26.5 SDK
stubs identify Foundation through Versions/C. Retain the qualified
SDK Gen exports and use the native install name for link clients.

--- a/Foundation.tbd
+++ b/Foundation.tbd
@@ -4,1 +4,1 @@
-install-name:    '/System/Library/Frameworks/Foundation.framework/Foundation'
+install-name:    '/System/Library/Frameworks/Foundation.framework/Versions/C/Foundation'
